(4) DERIVED RATIOS  None of the ratios in the map is derived from the floor. Which are arithmetic on inputs:
    exact identities of the dictionary: cycles = R E/(hbar c); cycles/(alpha/2) for the valence rung = Z_eff; 2 pi nats per cycle.
    ratios of two sourced numbers, nothing else: B/Mc^2, r_ch/lambda_tau, a0/lambda_e = 1/alpha = 137.035999, level step ratios.
    no ratio here follows from 2I/E8/12/30; 1/alpha, the lepton mass ratios and the nuclear 1.15 cycles are inputs to this map, not outputs of the floor.
